Follow `AGENTS.md` for Assignment 3 guardrails.

For every meaningful change:

1. Explain in chat (what, why, alternatives, risks, assignment fit, report impact).
2. Update the submission notebook under `/notebook/` (`assign3-ms7556.ipynb`).
3. Re-run in Colab and sync the notebook text, `/assets/`, `/artifacts/`, and the report to the new outputs.

The `.ipynb` is the technical deliverable. `Assignment3.pdf` is the authoritative spec.

Never invent results. Never fit the tokenizer on validation text, use forbidden attention APIs as the submitted model, or change more than one factor between configurations. Prefer small, justified notebook edits; keep the notebook submission-ready (no checkpoint/meta clutter). Verify with real outputs.

Details on data preparation, model rules, experiments, metrics, decisions, final results, report rules, and rubric are in `AGENTS.md`.
